{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landiscape is aimed to be a fun and relaxed open world sandbox survival game to enjoy with up to 4 friends. Live your life as a safe farmer and grow your crops, or live your life as a raider where you scavenge the fallen world and wage war against all your enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad up with your friends and hope that you can trust them, friendly fire is on. Landiscape has mobs ranging from classic zombies, large dino-like creatures, fast sprinting spiders, and even simple deer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/extras/a98f79f1e121ad70008c1c22f854201c.avif?t=1770340933\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/extras_big/a98f79f1e121ad70008c1c22f854201c.avif?t=1770340933 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runners charge without warning. Crawlers lurk in the shadows. Brutes crush through anything in their path. And it\u2019s not just the infected\u2014other survivors will do worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landiscape drops you into a hostile open world where every sound, shadow, and choice could be your last:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge &amp; craft</strong>: Turn junk and salvage into weapons, gear, and life-saving tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build anywhere</strong>: Reinforce a gas station, wall off a grocery store, or make a forest bunker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the undead</strong>: Face a dynamic AI horde that stalks, flanks, and evolves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt or be hunted</strong>: Fight for territory, supplies, and your next breath.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather. Fortify. Outlast.</strong><br>Nightfall brings no safety. In <i>Landiscape</i>, <strong>everything wants you dead.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2141620?t=1770340933","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2141620?t=1770340933","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/db6cad7efddb0467e2d1b0209b818e345e4f3e14/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770340933","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/db6cad7efddb0467e2d1b0209b818e345e4f3e14/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770340933","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Guns used in battle, players fighting other players using guns, explosives, weapons."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landiscape is aimed to be a fun and relaxed open world sandbox survival game to enjoy with up to 4 friends. Live your life as a safe farmer and grow your crops, or live your life as a raider where you scavenge the fallen world and wage war against all your enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad up with your friends and hope that you can trust them, friendly fire is on. Landiscape has mobs ranging from classic zombies, large dino-like creatures, fast sprinting spiders, and even simple deer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/extras/a98f79f1e121ad70008c1c22f854201c.avif?t=1770340933\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/extras_big/a98f79f1e121ad70008c1c22f854201c.avif?t=1770340933 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runners charge without warning. Crawlers lurk in the shadows. Brutes crush through anything in their path. And it\u2019s not just the infected\u2014other survivors will do worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landiscape drops you into a hostile open world where every sound, shadow, and choice could be your last:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge &amp; craft</strong>: Turn junk and salvage into weapons, gear, and life-saving tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build anywhere</strong>: Reinforce a gas station, wall off a grocery store, or make a forest bunker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the undead</strong>: Face a dynamic AI horde that stalks, flanks, and evolves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt or be hunted</strong>: Fight for territory, supplies, and your next breath.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather. Fortify. Outlast.</strong><br>Nightfall brings no safety. In <i>Landiscape</i>, <strong>everything wants you dead.</strong></p>","developers":["GTI"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/e69582d126a8dec16f96480019dc0ad25c46045e/header.jpg?t=1770340933","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2141620/1832775964/38c1d5f6fd4b6040536337ed83c8a3675ce6c23c/1770339880/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770340281","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2141620/1832775964/38c1d5f6fd4b6040536337ed83c8a3675ce6c23c/1770339880/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770340281","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/214